Troubleshooting Common Issues
Issue 1: Operator Installation Stuck
Symptoms: CSV remains in "Installing" phase for extended time

Solution:

# Check operator pod logs
oc logs -n openshift-cnv deployment/kubevirt-hyperconverged-operator

# Check install plan
oc get installplan -n openshift-cnv
Issue 2: HyperConverged Resource Not Ready
Symptoms: HyperConverged shows "Progressing" or "Degraded" status

Solution:

# Check HyperConverged status details
oc describe hco -n openshift-cnv kubevirt-hyperconverged

# Check individual component status
oc get kubevirt,cdi,ssp,networkaddonsconfig -n openshift-cnv
Issue 3: Insufficient Node Resources
Symptoms: Pods remain in Pending state

Solution:

# Check node resources
oc describe nodes

# Check pod events
oc get events -n openshift-cnv --sort-by='.lastTimestamp'
